#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11176
msgid "Gnumeric's: the Fourier transform of a sequence, or its inverse."
msgstr "Fra Gnumeric: Fourier-transformasjonen av en følge, eller den inverse."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11177
msgid "How many values fall in each bin."
msgstr "Hvor mange verdier som havner i hver klasse."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11178
msgid "Gnumeric's: Hodrick and Prescott's trend and what is left over."
msgstr "Fra Gnumeric: Hodrick–Prescott-trenden og det som blir til overs."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11179
msgid "Gnumeric's: the ordinates read off at the targets, six ways."
msgstr "Fra Gnumeric: ordinatene avlest ved målpunktene, på seks måter."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11180
msgid "Gnumeric's: how much each row of a design matrix pulls on the fit."
msgstr ""
"Fra Gnumeric: hvor mye hver rad i en designmatrise trekker i tilpasningen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11181
msgid "The least-squares line, with its statistics."
msgstr "Minste kvadraters linje, med tilhørende statistikk."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11182
msgid ""
"Gnumeric's fit of y = a + b ln(sign (x - c)): sign, a, b, c and the "
"residuals."
msgstr ""
"Gnumerics tilpasning av y = a + b ln(sign (x - c)): sign, a, b, c og "
"residualene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11183
msgid ""
"Gnumeric's: the least-squares fit of y = m ln(x) + b, with its statistics."
msgstr ""
"Fra Gnumeric: minste kvadraters tilpasning av y = m ln(x) + b, med "
"tilhørende statistikk."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11184
msgid "The inverse of a square matrix."
msgstr "Den inverse av en kvadratisk matrise."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11185
msgid "The product of two matrices."
msgstr "Produktet av to matriser."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11186
msgid "Gnumeric's: how much of each frequency is in a series."
msgstr "Fra Gnumeric: hvor mye av hver frekvens en serie inneholder."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11187
msgid "A rectangle turned on its side."
msgstr "Et rektangel snudd på siden."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11188
msgid "The columns named, in the order named."
msgstr "De angitte kolonnene, i angitt rekkefølge."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11189
msgid "The rows named, in the order named."
msgstr "De angitte radene, i angitt rekkefølge."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11190
msgid "So many rows and columns from the near end, or the far one."
msgstr "Et gitt antall rader og kolonner fra begynnelsen, eller fra slutten."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11191
msgid "The arrays one under another, short ones padded with #N/A."
msgstr "Matrisene under hverandre, de korte fylt ut med #N/A."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11192
msgid "The arrays side by side, short ones padded with #N/A."
msgstr "Matrisene side om side, de korte fylt ut med #N/A."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11193
msgid "The array grown to a size, the new cells #N/A or the padding."
msgstr ""
"Matrisen utvidet til en gitt størrelse, med #N/A eller utfyllingsverdien i "
"de nye cellene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11194
msgid "A vector folded into rows of so many."
msgstr "En vektor brettet til rader med et gitt antall elementer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11195
msgid "A vector folded into columns of so many."
msgstr "En vektor brettet til kolonner med et gitt antall elementer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11196
msgid "An array as one column, blanks or errors left out when asked."
msgstr "En matrise som én kolonne, eventuelt uten tomme celler eller feil."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11197
msgid "An array as one row, blanks or errors left out when asked."
msgstr "En matrise som én rad, eventuelt uten tomme celler eller feil."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11198
msgid "The identity matrix of a size."
msgstr "Identitetsmatrisen av en gitt størrelse."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11199
msgid "The range without its empty outer rows and columns."
msgstr "Området uten de tomme ytre radene og kolonnene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11200
msgid ""
"What a regular expression matches: the first match, all of them, or the "
"groups."
msgstr ""
"Det et regulært uttrykk treffer: første treff, alle treff eller gruppene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11201
msgid "A value from a pivot table; #REF! here, whose pivots are plain cells."
msgstr ""
"En verdi fra en pivottabell; #REF! her, der pivottabeller er vanlige celler."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11202
msgid "The rectangle with so many rows and columns left off."
msgstr "Rektangelet uten et gitt antall rader og kolonner."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11203
msgid "A text cut into a rectangle at its delimiters."
msgstr "En tekst delt opp i et rektangel ved skilletegnene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11204
msgid "Every value that turns up as often as the commonest."
msgstr "Alle verdier som forekommer like ofte som den hyppigste."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11205
msgid ""
"Gnumeric's: the lower triangle whose product with its transpose is the "
"matrix."
msgstr ""
"Fra Gnumeric: den nedre trekantmatrisen som ganget med sin transponerte gir "
"matrisen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11206
msgid ""
"Gnumeric's: the eigenvalues of a symmetric matrix, each with its vector "
"under it."
msgstr ""
"Fra Gnumeric: egenverdiene til en symmetrisk matrise, hver med sin "
"egenvektor under seg."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11207
msgid "Gnumeric's: Moore and Penrose's inverse, which any matrix has."
msgstr "Fra Gnumeric: Moore–Penrose-inversen, som enhver matrise har."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11268
msgid "The absolute value of a number."
msgstr "Absoluttverdien av et tall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11269
msgid "The arccosine, in radians."
msgstr "Arcus cosinus, i radianer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11270
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic cosine."
msgstr "Invers hyperbolsk cosinus."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11271
msgid "The arccotangent, in radians."
msgstr "Arcus cotangens, i radianer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11272
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic cotangent."
msgstr "Invers hyperbolsk cotangens."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11273
msgid "A cell reference as text."
msgstr "En cellereferanse som tekst."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11274
msgid "Anderson and Darling's test: the chance a sample this far from normal."
msgstr ""
"Anderson–Darlings test: sannsynligheten for at et utvalg avviker så mye fra "
"normalfordelingen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11275
msgid "TRUE if every argument is TRUE."
msgstr "TRUE hvis alle argumentene er TRUE."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11276
msgid "A Roman numeral as a number."
msgstr "Et romertall som tall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11277
msgid "The number of areas in a reference: one."
msgstr "Antall områder i en referanse: ett."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11278
msgid "A rectangle as text, plainly or in braces."
msgstr "Et rektangel som tekst, rett frem eller i krøllparenteser."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11279
msgid "Ascension Thursday, thirty-nine days after Easter."
msgstr "Kristi himmelfartsdag, trettini dager etter påske."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11280
msgid "Ash Wednesday, forty-six days before Easter."
msgstr "Askeonsdag, førtiseks dager før påske."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11281
msgid "The arcsine, in radians."
msgstr "Arcus sinus, i radianer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11282
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic sine."
msgstr "Invers hyperbolsk sinus."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11283
msgid "The arctangent, in radians."
msgstr "Arcus tangens, i radianer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11284
msgid "The arctangent of y/x, in radians, in the right quadrant."
msgstr "Arcus tangens til y/x, i radianer, i riktig kvadrant."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11285
msgid "The inverse hyperbolic tangent."
msgstr "Invers hyperbolsk tangens."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11286
msgid "The arithmetic mean; text and blanks in a range are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Det aritmetiske gjennomsnittet; tekst og tomme celler i et område hoppes "
"over."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11287
msgid "The average, counting text as 0 and TRUE as 1."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittet, der tekst teller som 0 og TRUE som 1."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11288
msgid "The mean of the cells that meet a condition."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittet av cellene som oppfyller et vilkår."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11289
msgid "The mean of the cells meeting every condition."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittet av cellene som oppfyller alle vilkårene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11290
msgid "A number as text in another base."
msgstr "Et tall som tekst i et annet tallsystem."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11291
msgid "The beta function."
msgstr "Betafunksjonen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11292
msgid "The beta distribution, density or cumulative."
msgstr "Betafordelingen, tetthet eller kumulativ."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11293
msgid "The logarithm of the beta function."
msgstr "Logaritmen til betafunksjonen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11294
msgid "The probability of a range of successes."
msgstr "Sannsynligheten for at antall suksesser ligger i et intervall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11295 src/formula/o42-eval.c:11325
msgid ""
"The smallest value whose cumulative binomial distribution reaches alpha."
msgstr "Den minste verdien der den kumulative binomiske fordelingen når alpha."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11296
msgid "Each column of an array through a function."
msgstr "Hver kolonne i en matrise sendt gjennom en funksjon."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11297
msgid "Each row of an array through a function."
msgstr "Hver rad i en matrise sendt gjennom en funksjon."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11298
msgid "The Cauchy, Lorentz or Breit-Wigner distribution."
msgstr "Cauchy-, Lorentz- eller Breit–Wigner-fordelingen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11299
msgid "Rounded up to the next whole number."
msgstr "Rundet opp til neste hele tall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11300
msgid "Rounds up, away from zero, to a multiple of significance."
msgstr "Runder opp, bort fra null, til et multiplum av significance."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11301 src/formula/o42-eval.c:11428
msgid "Rounds up to a multiple of the significance."
msgstr "Runder opp til et multiplum av significance."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11302
msgid "Rounded up towards plus infinity, whatever the sign."
msgstr "Rundet opp mot pluss uendelig, uansett fortegn."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11303
msgid "The chi-squared distribution, density or cumulative."
msgstr "Kjikvadratfordelingen, tetthet eller kumulativ."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11304
msgid "The inverse of the left-tailed chi-squared distribution."
msgstr "Den inverse av den venstresidige kjikvadratfordelingen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11305 src/formula/o42-eval.c:11308
msgid "The chi-squared test for independence."
msgstr "Kjikvadrattesten for uavhengighet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11306
msgid "The chi-squared distribution, as Gnumeric names it."
msgstr "Kjikvadratfordelingen, slik Gnumeric kaller den."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11307
msgid "The value of chi-squared with the given probability below it."
msgstr "Kjikvadratverdien som har den gitte sannsynligheten under seg."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11309
msgid "The value at a given position in the list."
msgstr "Verdien på en gitt plass i listen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11310
msgid "The column number of a reference, or of this cell."
msgstr "Kolonnenummeret til en referanse, eller til denne cellen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11311
msgid "How many ways k things can be chosen from n."
msgstr "Hvor mange måter k ting kan velges blant n."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11312
msgid "Combinations with repetition."
msgstr "Kombinasjoner med repetisjon."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11313
msgid "Half the width of a confidence interval, by Student's t."
msgstr "Halve bredden av et konfidensintervall, etter Students t."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11314
msgid "A measurement in other units: CONVERT(1,\"mi\",\"km\")."
msgstr "En måling i andre enheter: CONVERT(1,\"mi\",\"km\")."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11315
msgid "The cosine of an angle in radians."
msgstr "Cosinus til en vinkel i radianer."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11316
msgid "The hyperbolic cosine."
msgstr "Hyperbolsk cosinus."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11317
msgid "The cotangent."
msgstr "Cotangens."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11318
msgid "The hyperbolic cotangent."
msgstr "Hyperbolsk cotangens."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11319
msgid "How many of the arguments are numbers."
msgstr "Hvor mange av argumentene som er tall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11320
msgid "How many of the arguments are not blank."
msgstr "Hvor mange av argumentene som ikke er tomme."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11321
msgid "How many cells in a range are blank."
msgstr "Hvor mange celler i et område som er tomme."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11322
msgid "How many cells meet a condition such as \">5\" or \"a*\"."
msgstr "Hvor mange celler som oppfyller et vilkår som \">5\" eller \"a*\"."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11323
msgid "How many cells meet every condition."
msgstr "Hvor mange celler som oppfyller alle vilkårene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11324
msgid "The sample covariance."
msgstr "Utvalgskovariansen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11326
msgid "Cronbach's alpha: how far the items measure one thing."
msgstr "Cronbachs alfa: i hvor stor grad leddene måler det samme."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11327
msgid "The cosecant."
msgstr "Cosekans."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11328
msgid "The hyperbolic cosecant."
msgstr "Hyperbolsk cosekans."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11329
msgid "Interest paid between two periods of a loan."
msgstr "Renter betalt mellom to perioder av et lån."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11330
msgid "Principal paid between two periods of a loan."
msgstr "Avdrag betalt mellom to perioder av et lån."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11331
msgid "The Julian day number of a date."
msgstr "Det julianske dagnummeret for en dato."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11332
msgid "A date as Unix time: seconds since the start of 1970."
msgstr "En dato som Unix-tid: sekunder siden begynnelsen av 1970."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11333
msgid "The mean of a field in the records that match the criteria."
msgstr "Gjennomsnittet av et felt i postene som samsvarer med kriteriene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11334
msgid "Fixed-declining-balance depreciation."
msgstr "Avskrivning med fast degressiv saldo."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11335
msgid "How many records match the criteria and hold a number in the field."
msgstr ""
"Hvor mange poster som samsvarer med kriteriene og har et tall i feltet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11336
msgid "How many records match the criteria and are not blank in the field."
msgstr ""
"Hvor mange poster som samsvarer med kriteriene og ikke er tomme i feltet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11337
msgid "Depreciation by the double-declining balance method."
msgstr "Avskrivning med dobbel degressiv saldometode."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11338
msgid "Text in another base as a number."
msgstr "Tekst i et annet tallsystem som tall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11339
msgid "Radians to degrees."
msgstr "Radianer til grader."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11340
msgid "The field of the one record that matches the criteria."
msgstr "Feltet i den ene posten som samsvarer med kriteriene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11341
msgid "The largest value of a field in the matching records."
msgstr "Den største verdien av et felt i de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11342
msgid "The smallest value of a field in the matching records."
msgstr "Den minste verdien av et felt i de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11343
msgid "A price quoted as a fraction, as a decimal."
msgstr "En pris notert som brøk, som desimaltall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11344
msgid "A decimal price as a fraction quote."
msgstr "En desimalpris som brøknotering."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11345
msgid "The product of a field in the matching records."
msgstr "Produktet av et felt i de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11346
msgid "The sample standard deviation of a field in the matching records."
msgstr "Utvalgsstandardavviket for et felt i de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11347
msgid "Population standard deviation of matching records."
msgstr "Populasjonsstandardavviket for de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11348
msgid "The sum of a field in the records that match the criteria."
msgstr "Summen av et felt i postene som samsvarer med kriteriene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11349
msgid "The sample variance of a field in the matching records."
msgstr "Utvalgsvariansen for et felt i de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11350
msgid "Population variance of matching records."
msgstr "Populasjonsvariansen for de samsvarende postene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11351
msgid "Easter Sunday, by the Gregorian computus."
msgstr "Første påskedag, etter den gregorianske påskeberegningen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11352
msgid "The effective annual interest rate."
msgstr "Den effektive årlige renten."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11353
msgid "The error value that text names."
msgstr "Feilverdien som teksten angir."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11354
msgid "A number for each kind of error value."
msgstr "Et tall for hver type feilverdi."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11355
msgid ""
"One of nineteen aggregates, leaving out hidden rows or errors as the options "
"say."
msgstr ""
"Én av nitten mengdefunksjoner, som utelater skjulte rader eller feil slik "
"alternativene angir."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11356
msgid "Rounds away from zero to an even integer."
msgstr "Runder bort fra null til et partall."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11357
msgid "e raised to a power."
msgstr "e opphøyd i en potens."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11358
msgid "exp(x) - 1, keeping the digits a small x would lose."
msgstr "exp(x) - 1, uten å miste sifrene en liten x ellers ville mistet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11359
msgid "The density of the exponential power distribution."
msgstr "Tettheten til den eksponentielle potensfordelingen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11360
msgid "The F distribution, density or cumulative."
msgstr "F-fordelingen, tetthet eller kumulativ."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11361
msgid "The inverse of the left-tailed F distribution."
msgstr "Den inverse av den venstresidige F-fordelingen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11362
msgid "The two-tailed F-test probability."
msgstr "Den tosidige sannsynligheten i en F-test."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11363
msgid "The factorial."
msgstr "Fakultet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11364
msgid "The double factorial."
msgstr "Dobbelt fakultet."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11365
msgid "The logical value FALSE."
msgstr "Den logiske verdien FALSE."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11366
msgid "The rows (or columns) of an array where a condition holds."
msgstr "Radene (eller kolonnene) i en matrise der et vilkår er oppfylt."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11367
msgid "The Fisher transformation."
msgstr "Fisher-transformasjonen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11368
msgid "The inverse of the Fisher transformation."
msgstr "Den inverse av Fisher-transformasjonen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11369
msgid "Rounds down, toward zero, to a multiple of significance."
msgstr "Runder ned, mot null, til et multiplum av significance."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11370
msgid "Rounds down to a multiple of the significance."
msgstr "Runder ned til et multiplum av significance."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11371
msgid "Rounded down towards minus infinity, whatever the sign."
msgstr "Rundet ned mot minus uendelig, uansett fortegn."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11372
msgid "What was typed into a cell, formula and all."
msgstr "Det som ble skrevet inn i en celle, med formel og alt."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11373
msgid "The two-tailed F-test probability that the variances differ."
msgstr "Den tosidige sannsynligheten i en F-test for at variansene er ulike."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11374
msgid "The future value of regular payments."
msgstr "Den fremtidige verdien av regelmessige innbetalinger."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11375
msgid "The gamma function."
msgstr "Gammafunksjonen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11376
msgid "The probability between the mean and z standard deviations."
msgstr "Sannsynligheten mellom gjennomsnittet og z standardavvik."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11377
msgid "The greatest common divisor."
msgstr "Største felles divisor."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11378
msgid "How many failures before the first success."
msgstr "Hvor mange fiaskoer før den første suksessen."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11379
msgid "A value from the machine's environment."
msgstr "En verdi fra maskinens miljø."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11380
msgid "Good Friday, two days before Easter."
msgstr "Langfredag, to dager før påske."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11381
msgid "Values on the exponential curve fitted to the points."
msgstr "Verdier på eksponentialkurven tilpasset punktene."

#: src/formula/o42-eval.c:11382
